55.51.e:
“Whoever has faith in the Realized One,
unwavering and well grounded;
whose ethical conduct is good,
praised and loved by the noble ones;

56.22.s:
Tañca maggaṁ na jānanti,
Dukkhūpasamagāminaṁ;
Cetovimuttihīnā te,
Atho paññāvimuttiyā;
Abhabbā te antakiriyāya,
Te ve jātijarūpagā.

Tañca maggaṁ pajānanti,
dukkhūpasamagāminaṁ;
Cetovimuttisampannā,
atho paññāvimuttiyā;
Bhabbā te antakiriyāya,
na te jātijarūpagā”ti.
